    "means the arity is known but the types are not, and the emitter prints the",
    "raw register values. A number absent from this table is not an error: it",
    "emits as __xdec_syscall(nr, ...), which is still more than the instruction said.",
    "Types here are spellings, not TypeIds. They are looked up in the imported type",
    "database when one is present, so 'struct timeval*' becomes a real cast only if",
    "a header defined it; otherwise it stays a comment on the argument."
